  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder and resnet50 image encoder (config_033) achieve the highest accuracy (0.713). This experiment tests whether using the imagenet_vit_l image encoder (a stronger baseline) with avgpool aggregation and concat fusion (instead of transformer aggregation and weighted fusion) could improve performance. It isolates the effect of image encoder choice and aggregation method, which are critical design decisions with uncertain impact. This is a logical extension of the current best configuration and helps validate whether the current success is due to specific components or general multimodal synergy."
